#
# Digital Voice Modem - Radio Alias List
#
# This file sets the radio aliases. This file should always end with an empty line!
#
#   * RID               [REQUIRED] - Unique Radio ID.
#   * ALIAS             [REQUIRED] - Textual string representing an alias for this radio ID entry.
#
# Entry Format: "RID,Alias,<newline>"
# Example:
#1234,RID Alias,
